---
name: dev-sanity-complete
version: 1.2.1
description: Sanity check report; the body of `atm task close <task-id> completed`. PASS closes the sanity check bead; FAIL leaves it open; dev-sanity has reopened the checked bead and filed these findings under it.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - task_id
  - checked_bead
  - sprint
  - branch
  - commit
  - verdict
  - findings_count
  - findings_md
  - lint_md
optional_variables:
  - run_id
  - reviewer
  - notes_md
  - finding_bead_ids
defaults:
  run_id: "legacy"
  reviewer: "sanity-llm"
  notes_md: ""
  finding_bead_ids: []
  selection: []
metadata:
  type: dev-sanity-complete
  tags:
    - stage:dev-sanity
    - orchestration:beads
  workflow:
    scope:
      kind: sprint
      variable: sprint
    state: dev-sanity-complete
    stage: dev-sanity
    transition: complete
---
{% if verdict not in ["PASS", "FAIL"] %}{{ verdict | verdict_must_be_PASS_or_FAIL }}ERROR: verdict must be PASS or FAIL, got {{ verdict }}
{% endif %}# Dev Sanity Check {{ verdict }}

Generated: {{ generated_at }}
Run: {{ run_id }} · Operational reviewer: {{ reviewer }}
Bead: {{ task_id }} (sprint {{ sprint }})
Checked: {{ checked_bead }} on `{{ branch }}` at `{{ commit }}`
Verdict: **{{ verdict }}** ({{ findings_count }} findings)

## Machine Status (JSON)
```json
{
  "run_id": {{ run_id | tojson }},
  "reviewer": {{ reviewer | tojson }},
  "task": {{ task_id | tojson }},
  "checked_bead": {{ checked_bead | tojson }},
  "sprint": {{ sprint | tojson }},
  "branch": {{ branch | tojson }},
  "commit": {{ commit | tojson }},
  "verdict": {{ verdict | tojson }},
  "findings": {{ findings_count }},
  "selection": {{ (selection or []) | tojson }},
  "finding_bead_ids": {{ finding_bead_ids | tojson }}
}
```

## Selection
{% for item in selection or [] %}
- D{{ item.deliverable }}: LLM={{ item.llm }}, JEV={{ item.jev }}, selected={{ item.selected }}, checker_defect={{ item.checker_defect }}{% if item.reason %}; {{ item.reason }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

## Checker Defects
{% set checker_defects = (selection or []) | selectattr("checker_defect") | list %}
{% for item in checker_defects %}
- D{{ item.deliverable }}: {{ item.reason }}
{% else %}
- None.
{% endfor %}

## Findings
{{ findings_md }}

## Lint
{{ lint_md }}
{% if notes_md %}
## Notes
{{ notes_md }}
{% endif %}
